# Locate an arbitrary object on the table by natural-language instruction, via
# the head camera + a vision-language model (open vocabulary, not limited to the
# YOLO cube classes).
# Request: what to find, in natural language.
# Response: whether detection ran, a message, and the matched objects as JSON.
string instruction    # required: what to locate, e.g. "红色的杯子" / "离机械臂最近的螺丝刀"
---
bool ok               # true if detection ran (even if no matching object was found)
string message        # human-readable summary / error detail
string objects        # JSON array: [{"class_name","score","x","y","z","grasp_angle_deg"}], base frame, metres
